  "description": "Big See may seem simple on the surface, but at its core is a moving story about a man diagnosed with cancer. Readers witness the journey that unfolds in his subconscious as he battles cancer, and the emotional battle his loved ones find themselves embroiled in. What is it like to live with the knowledge that your life on earth will soon come to an end? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes one extra chapter.*",
